# VCNL36866 proximity (rog5_vcnl36866, IIO): iio-sensor-proxy ignores a
# proximity sensor without PROXIMITY_NEAR_LEVEL ("Found proximity sensor but
# no PROXIMITY_NEAR_LEVEL udev property"), so Phosh never blanked on the ear.
# This unit's factory calibration (factory partition, psensor_*.nv, read-only
# 2026-09-30): inf 97, 5 cm 145, 3 cm 239, 1 cm 4095; in_proximity_raw read 98
# uncovered. Near = above the 3 cm value, as the stock driver's high threshold.
SUBSYSTEM=="iio", ATTR{name}=="vcnl36866", ENV{PROXIMITY_NEAR_LEVEL}="239"
